    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408580/extras/90b8c2282e925a7aae9abc255f6694e3.avif?t=1750357560\" /></div><br>Voxel Tactics is a strategy RPG where you take command of a band of plucky heroes as they journey across a vast and dangerous world full of magic, monsters and mighty empires!<br><br>Recruit a from a wide range of interesting characters as you take on quests to rid the land of evil. Build and expand your hometown and fill it with villagers some with their own stories and quest lines for you to tackle. <br><br>Battle, recruit and build your way to victory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408580/extras/3e1259acd301dc1fed825f5686716a31.poster.avif?t=1750357560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408580/extras/3e1259acd301dc1fed825f5686716a31.webm?t=1750357560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408580/extras/3e1259acd301dc1fed825f5686716a31.mp4?t=1750357560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408580/extras/2a4f712cb4aaf8e8a43fb593b1b589cf.poster.avif?t=1750357560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408580/extras/2a4f712cb4aaf8e8a43fb593b1b589cf.webm?t=1750357560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408580/extras/2a4f712cb4aaf8e8a43fb593b1b589cf.mp4?t=1750357560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
